      "claimA": "Teaches `expect class` as THE pattern for every platform service, including ones that clearly need Context injection and lifecycle ownership: `expect class SecureStorage` (Android actual needs Context), `expect class DatabasePathProvider` (needs Context), and `expect class ConnectivityMonitor` with `startMonitoring()`/`stopMonitoring()` lifecycle and Context. The skill never mentions the interface-based alternative at all.",
